<title>USA: PaineWebber up on takeover rumors.</title>
<headline>PaineWebber up on takeover rumors.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Group Inc shares rose sharply Friday after a published report said the New York-based broker was being eyed as a takeover target by BankAmerica Corp and others.</p>
<p>Both PaineWebber and BankAmerica declined comment on the report, which appeared in Business Week's Inside Wall Street column.</p>
<p>A Wall Street source said he did not think information in the column was accurate. The source declined to be identified.</p>
<p>PaineWebber was up 3-3/4 to 31-1/2 in afternoon trade. BankAmerica was up 3/8 to 106-1/4.</p>
